{"id":"fb072532ce0d892d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-tower-family.md","title":"ZFC Tower Family","display":"df-zfc-tower-family — ZFC Tower Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tower-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tower-family"],"display":"df-zfc-tower-family — ZFC Tower Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch20/58-df-well-order]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tower-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tower-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tower-family — ZFC Tower Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order\">../batch20/58-df-well-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> (family candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}\\)</span> (well-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order\">../batch20/58-df-well-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TowerFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TowerFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TowerFamily}_S(\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\n\\land\n\\exists R\\;\n\\Bigl(\nR=\n\\left\\{\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T^2:\n\\mathrm{Finite}(B\\setminus A)\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{WellOrder}(\\mathcal T,R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists X\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal T\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TowerFamily}_S(\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\n\\land\n\\exists R\\;\n\\Bigl(\nR=\n\\left\\{\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T^2:\n\\mathrm{Finite}(B\\setminus A)\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{WellOrder}(\\mathcal T,R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists X\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal T\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pairwise comparability is not enough for a tower; the reverse almost-inclusion relation must well-order the family, and no infinite pseudointersection may exist.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-well-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WellOrder}$ (well-order predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-well-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WellOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TowerFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tower\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TowerFamily}_S(\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\n\\land\n\\exists R\\;\n\\Bigl(\nR=\n\\left\\{\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T^2:\n\\mathrm{Finite}(B\\setminus A)\n\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{WellOrder}(\\mathcal T,R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists X\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal T\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X\\setminus A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1317,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3748","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-tower-family.md|58-df-zfc-tower-family]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}